title Delivery-delay pipelines on Apache Airflow
subtitle 46 daily order CSVs to a validated, versioned model, all inside Docker Compose
dir down
group compose Docker Compose
group dp data_pipeline (daily) in compose
group ml ml_training_pipeline in compose
raw Raw CSVs @file-text ~ 46 files orders_YYYY-MM-DD.csv, never modified
bronze Bronze in dp ~ Unchanged copy of the day's file
silver Silver in dp ~ Deduplicated, standardised, invalid values set to missing
gold Gold in dp ~ Model features + target, one partition per date
validate Validate Gold in dp !accent ~ Fails on empty data, missing columns, duplicate IDs, wrong dates, bad labels
pg Postgres processed (cylinder) in compose ~ gold_orders table, replaced per date
asset gold_orders Asset (note) in compose ~ Updated only when validation passes
load Load Gold in ml ~ Concatenate every Gold partition
train Train model in ml ~ Time-based split, sklearn Pipeline fitted on train dates
evaluate Evaluate in ml ~ Accuracy, precision, recall, F1 on later dates
save Save model in ml ~ joblib model, metrics.json and a version folder
raw -> bronze
bronze -> silver
silver -> gold
gold -> validate
validate -> pg load
validate --> asset updates
asset --> load triggers
load -> train
train -> evaluate
evaluate -> save
